From 2e0143a76a0dd18546657405007ed41da9b3bb45 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 13:11:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: repair type-check and align tests with unlimited
 bookings

- password: type the scrypt wrapper explicitly (util.promisify dropped the options overload)
- tests: drop the obsolete reservationCapacity option and capacity assertions; bookings
  are never rejected for overlap, only an identical planned slot of the same profile is a duplicate
- booking worker: register tsx inside the worker thread so the concurrency test can load TS sources
- ui: remove capacity-based disabling of the reservation button and the misleading
  'no places left' message for HTTP 409
